<title>USA: Studio Plus opens two new hotels, total 35.</title>
<headline>Studio Plus opens two new hotels, total 35.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Studio Plus Hotels Inc said Tuesday it opened two new hotels in Ft. Wayne, Indiana and Memphis, Tennessee, bringing the number of hotels the company has opened in 1996 to 13.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that with the new additions, it now operates a total of 35 hotels.</p>
